---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../lib/content";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions"
  description="Terms and conditions for Wayside Church website and SMS text messaging communications."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell page-hero__inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <p>These terms govern your use of the Wayside Church website and participation in our SMS text messaging program.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell legal-copy">
      <p class="legal-copy__updated"><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 14, 2026</p>

      <h2>Agreement to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms and Conditions apply to your use of the Wayside Church website at <a href="https://wayside.church">wayside.church</a>
        and to text messages sent by or on behalf of Wayside Church. By using this website or opting in to our text messaging program,
        you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the website or enroll in the text messaging program.
      </p>

      <h2>SMS text messaging program</h2>
      <p>
        When you provide your mobile number and opt in, you authorize Wayside Church to send recurring automated or non-automated SMS
        or MMS messages to that number. Messages may include church announcements, worship or event reminders, ministry updates,
        volunteer coordination, schedule changes, and other communications related to the life of Wayside Church.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Consent:</strong> Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of attending Wayside Church, making a donation, or receiving services.</li>
        <li><strong>Message frequency:</strong> Message frequency varies based on church activities and the communications you request.</li>
        <li><strong>Charges:</strong> Message and data rates may apply according to your mobile carrier and service plan.</li>
        <li><strong>Opt out:</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to unsubscribe. You may receive one final message confirming your opt-out. After that confirmation, no additional messages will be sent unless you opt in again.</li>
        <li><strong>Help:</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance, or call Wayside Church at <a href={site.contact.phoneHref}>{site.contact.phone}</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Carrier responsibility:</strong> Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Delivery is subject to effective transmission by your carrier and is not guaranteed.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your consent and mobile information</h2>
      <p>
        Your consent applies only to communications from Wayside Church for the purposes described above. We do not sell, rent, or share
        your mobile number or SMS opt-in consent with third parties for their own marketing or promotional purposes. We may use service
        providers only as needed to operate the messaging program, support church communications, or comply with the law.
      </p>

      <h2>Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our collection and use of personal information is also governed by the
        <a href={withBase("/privacy-policy/")}>Wayside Church Privacy Policy</a>. The Privacy Policy and these Terms and Conditions are
        separate documents and should be reviewed together.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable website use</h2>
      <p>
        You may use this website for lawful, personal, and noncommercial purposes. You may not attempt to disrupt the website, gain
        unauthorized access to its systems, introduce malicious code, impersonate Wayside Church or another person, or use the website
        in a way that violates applicable law or the rights of others.
      </p>

      <h2>Website information and third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        We work to keep information on this website accurate and current, but we do not guarantee that every page or external link will
        always be complete, available, or error-free. Links to third-party websites and services are provided for convenience. Their use
        is governed by the third party's own terms and privacy practices.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        Wayside Church may update these terms from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.
        Continued use of the website or messaging program after an update constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Wayside Church</h2>
      <address>
        <strong>{site.church.name}</strong><br />
        {site.contact.addressLine1}<br />
        {site.contact.cityStateZip}<br />
        <a href={site.contact.phoneHref}>{site.contact.phone}</a>
      </address>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-copy {
    max-width: 850px;
  }

  .legal-copy__updated {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .legal-copy h2 {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 5vw, 2.2rem);
  }

  .legal-copy ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .legal-copy li,
  .legal-copy address {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal-copy address {
    font-style: normal;
  }
</style>

